              <p className="wp-block-paragraph [margin-top:0] [margin-bottom:1rem] [-webkit-box-sizing:border-box] [-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased] [font-weight:400]">These numbers indicate the growing popularity of mobile <a href="/" className="[color:#066fdf] [text-decoration:none] hover:[color:#0d0c38] [background-color:#fff0] visited:[color:#000] focus:[color:#191970] active:[color:#191970] focus:[outline:0] hover:[outline:0] active:[outline:0] [-webkit-box-sizing:border-box] [-webkit-text-decoration-skip:objects] hover:[text-decoration:none] [-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased] [-webkit-transition:all_0.35s] [transition:all_0.35s] [cursor:pointer] [box-shadow:none]">health app development</a> and large-scale failure.</p>
