              <p className="wp-block-paragraph [margin-top:0] [margin-bottom:1rem] [-webkit-box-sizing:border-box] [-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased] [font-weight:400]">These tips and resources will get you started right away, and you’ll walk away with a good understanding of healthcare mobile app mechanics and insight from thought leaders who teach this on a regular basis.</p>
