                    <li className="[-webkit-box-sizing:border-box] [-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased] [font-size:.9em] [line-height:1.5] [font-weight:400]">“It’s time to check your heart rate. Sit down, relax and take your heart rate reading.”</li>
